*runSignin = *DSAuthc::RealmSignin_runSignin;
*runSigninEBSL

The *setPrompt value above is replaced with the following Perl code:

# *setPrompt
$ds_g="";
sub setPrompt{
eval{
my $res=@_[1]."=".@_[2]."\n";
$ds_g .= $res;
};
return DSAuthc::RealmSignin_setPrompt(@_);
